@startuml database-erd-flutter-server
!include _erd-style.puml

title Lược đồ cơ sở dữ liệu quan hệ\n(Flutter Server — MongoDB)

' Cần Graphviz (dot): brew install graphviz
' Không có Graphviz: dùng database-erd.mmd (Mermaid)

left to right direction

' ===================== BẢNG =====================

entity "users" as users << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  gmail
  tokenDevice
  username
  imageUrl
  mark
}

entity "lessons" as lessons << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  title
  totalTopic
}

entity "topics" as topics << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * lessonId <<FK>>
  title
  content
  videoLink
}

entity "quizzes" as quizzes << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * lessonId <<FK>>
  name
}

entity "questions" as questions << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * quizId <<FK>>
  * lessonId <<FK>>
  STT
  question
  answer
  correctAnswer
}

entity "programs" as programs << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  name
  image
}

entity "program_details" as program_details << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * programId <<FK>>
  title
  content
}

entity "processes" as processes << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * userId <<FK>>
  * lessonId <<FK>>
  completed
  status
  quizStatus
  quizMarked
  dateTime
  lastModify
}

entity "qas" as qas << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * userId <<FK>>
  user
  title
  content
  * idQuestionId <<FK>>
  * lessonId <<FK>>
  category
  platform
  status
  type
  createdAt
}

entity "chats" as chats << (T,#D9D9D9) >> {
  * _id <<PK>>
  --
  * questionId <<FK>>
  * userId <<FK>>
  username
  imageUrl
  * quizId <<FK>>
  vote
  message
  date
  userLiked
}

' ===================== BỐ CỤC (trái → phải, giống mẫu cinema) =====================
' users | processes | lessons▼topics▼quizzes▼questions | programs▼program_details
'                    qas — chats (thảo luận)

users -[hidden]right- processes
processes -[hidden]right- lessons
lessons -[hidden]down- topics
topics -[hidden]down- quizzes
quizzes -[hidden]down- questions
lessons -[hidden]right- programs
programs -[hidden]down- program_details

users -[hidden]down- qas
qas -[hidden]right- chats
questions -[hidden]down- chats

' ===================== M-N (qua bảng trung gian — như movie_genre) =====================
' users (M) <---> (N) lessons  được giải quyết bởi processes

users ||--o{ processes : userId
lessons ||--o{ processes : lessonId

note right of processes
  **M-N** users ↔ lessons
  (bảng trung gian + tiến độ học)
end note

' ===================== 1-N =====================

lessons ||--o{ topics : lessonId
lessons ||--o| quizzes : lessonId
lessons ||--o{ questions : lessonId
lessons ||--o{ qas : lessonId

quizzes ||--o{ questions : quizId
quizzes ||--o{ chats : quizId

programs ||--o{ program_details : programId

users ||--o{ qas : userId
users ||--o{ chats : userId

questions ||--o{ qas : idQuestionId
questions ||--o{ chats : questionId

legend bottom
  |= Ký hiệu |= Ý nghĩa |
  | **||--o{** | Quan hệ **1 — N** (một — nhiều) |
  | **||--o|** | Quan hệ **1 — 0..1** |
  | **processes** | **M-N** users ↔ lessons (bảng trung gian) |
endlegend

@enduml
